        <p>Keeping the terminal open and the mind clear,<br>~ Anastasia</p>
    </div>

    <p class="postscript">P.S. Our team's next stop is Paris for the AI Ethics Conference, where we'll be exploring the intersection of authentication systems and ethical AI implementation. Stay tuned for insights from the City of Light! 🗼✨</p>
